"""World mode cast: Avatar: The Last Airbender and Gurren Lagann."""

# Quests, three per CPU, as one story each (docs/world-scenes-plan.md and the new three-quest shape). Scene order: the start
# scene is the hook (wherever the player is); the visit scene is the event at that place; a stage scene after a duel is what
# the duel changed; an ending scene is the aftermath and points to the next quest.
#
# Cameos: Katara's arc needs Simon the digger (he dug up half her forms scroll), Sokka's needs Toph (her verdict on the
# sword), Toph's needs Kittan (he bought her old belt at the shop), Simon's (grown-up) needs Anti Spiral, and Lord Genome's
# needs Ainz (a king's test). Aang and Azula are the one pair that lock each other: Aang's Best friend "reach" ending closes
# Azula's Best friend "crown", and her "crown" closes his "avatar state". Simon and Anti Spiral lock the same way.

